# QA M4 Zaunerstollen on the Kaiserterrasse (upper route). The relaxed run
# as Hackl down to the Rössl street (4351; 4270 before the pen-wall re-cut), under balcony B1 right of
# singer #1 (col 219 since the M4 level fix; the B1 Oblate moved to 217, off
# this route), a standing jump up through B1 in his idle window, B1 -> B2
# (3 Oblaten), a walking jump from B2's edge over the 4-gap onto the
# flower box and the terrace, a hop under the Z-box (col 237): the
# Zaunerstollen rises, rolls right through singer #3 to the chimney,
# rolls back and is caught: +1 life.
